2523-scaled.jpg 856w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" />  <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-29396\" src=\"http://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/wp-16912942415283455619355645808490-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" srcset=\"https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/wp-16912942415283455619355645808490-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/wp-16912942415283455619355645808490-300x225.jpg 300w, https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/wp-16912942415283455619355645808490-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/wp-16912942415283455619355645808490-768x576.jpg 768w, https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/wp-16912942415283455619355645808490-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/wp-16912942415283455619355645808490-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, http://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/wp-16912942415283455619355645808490-scaled.jpg 856w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-29397\" src=\"http://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/wp-16912942421402222460576301867205-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" srcset=\"https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/wp-16912942421402222460576301867205-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/wp-16912942421402222460576301867205-300x225.jpg 300w, https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/wp-16912942421402222460576301867205-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/wp-16912942421402222460576301867205-768x576.jpg 768w, https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/wp-16912942421402222460576301867205-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/wp-16912942421402222460576301867205-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, http://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/