   "html": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>2026年7月25日(土)、26日（日）、 <span class=\"marker2\"><strong>「仲田夏まつり」</strong></span>が仲田本通商店街で開催！！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-45110\" src=\"http://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1300x_ea1e9d427fb5664c32c517a73e421e58_fd2dbede1dc117520b5b0cbfdaa7a72182bd7edd.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"905\" height=\"640\" srcset=\"https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1300x_ea1e9d427fb5664c32c517a73e421e58_fd2dbede1dc117520b5b0cbfdaa7a72182bd7edd.jpg 905w, https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1300x_ea1e9d427fb5664c32c517a73e421e58_fd2dbede1dc117520b5b0cbfdaa7a72182bd7edd-300x212.jpg 300w, https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1300x_ea1e9d427fb5664c32c517a73e421e58_fd2dbede1dc117520b5b0cbfdaa7a72182bd7edd-768x543.jpg 768w, http://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1300x_ea1e9d427fb5664c32c517a73e421e58_fd2dbede1dc117520b5b0cbfdaa7a72182bd7edd.jpg 856w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 905px) 100vw, 905px\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-45111\" src=\"http://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/スクリーンショット-2026-07-23-222241.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"651\" height=\"646\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-45112\" src=\"http://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/スクリーンショット-2026-07-23-222258.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"570\" height=\"542\" />\n<p>場所はこちら！！　仲田本通商店街です！！</p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" style=\"border: 0;\" src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3261.468310487666!2d136.9398215449796!3d35.16987864189622!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x600370603d48b943%3A0x6915bffe7c010c5f!2z5Luy55Sw5pys6YCa77yI44OQ44K577yJ!5e0!3m2!1sja!2sjp!4v1688403310384!5m2!1sja!2sjp\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>こちら以前の様子です！！</p>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-35996\" src=\"http://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/wp-17195430434071963382764108567340.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" srcset=\"https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/wp-17195430434071963382764108567340.jpg 1024w, https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/wp-17195430434071963382764108567340-300x225.jpg 300w, https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/wp-17195430434071963382764108567340-768x576.jpg 768w, http://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/wp-17195430434071963382764108567340.jpg 856w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-35995\" src=\"http://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/wp-17195430433697253797282084951473.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" srcset=\"https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/wp-17195430433697253797282084951473.jpg 1024w, https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/wp-17195430433697253797282084951473-300x225.jpg 300w, https://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/wp-17195430433697253797282084951473-768x576.jpg 768w, http://chiku-san.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/wp-17195430433697253797282084951473.jpg 856w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>夏まつりの季節ですね！！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>当日は広小路通の仲田銀座商店街のおまつりも開催です！！</p>\n<p>https://chiku-san.com/20260623-nakataginza-matsuri/</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>覚王山夏祭は開催なしです。（今後も開催されないかもとの情報も・・・）</p>\n<p>https://chiku-san.com/20260623-kakuozan-fes-summer/</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>☆2026年千種区のおまつり情報はこちら</p>\n<p>↓↓↓</p>\n<p>https://chiku-san.com/20260710-natsumatsuri-chikusa-matome/</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>※この記事情報は2026年7月23日時点のものです。</p>\n<p>https://chiku-san.com/information-form/</p>\n"
